{"title":"Endomorphism","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>An <b>endomorphism</b> of a stucture <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Homomorphism\" title=\"Homomorphism\">homomorphism</a> of that structure to itself.  It need not be <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Injective\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Injective\">injective</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Surjective\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surjective\">surjective</a>.\n</p><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Endomorphism&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Endomorphism&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Homomorphism\" title=\"Homomorphism\">Homomorphism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Isomorphism\" title=\"Isomorphism\">Isomorphism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Automorphism\" title=\"Automorphism\">Automorphism</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018083445\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 19/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 277/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 171/5000000 bytes\n-